# The Towers game server with an ArduPlane SITL for each drone (domains/recreation/towers_server).

Section: The game with ArduPlane drones
  Launch: start the Towers game server. Run `cargo run --release -p recreation_towers_server -- --speedup 10`. The server starts ten ArduPlane SITL drones, and a computer commander for each team
  The game server flies a whole game with real ArduPlane flight controllers. Its report at the end
  tells you how the drones flew and what each team took.
